{"rule":"lemma-pool/v1","groups":{"liberar":{"host":"6a30651a","siblings":["5e9538e2"]}},"rows":{"5e9538e2":{"word":"liberado","rank":9429,"meanings":[{"headword":"liberar","pos":"verb","source_reference":"kaikki:en-liberar-pt-verb-CzXizRym","translation":"to clear, to give clearance"},{"headword":"liberar","pos":"verb","source_reference":"kaikki:en-liberar-pt-verb-j~~xIX28","translation":"to release (free, liberate)"},{"headword":"liberar","pos":"verb","source_reference":"kaikki:en-liberar-pt-verb-uYaL2FS0","translation":"to discharge (from medical obligations)"}]}},"examples":{"5e9538e2":{"m":[[{"t":"Não era permitido ver até você ser liberado.","e":"But you weren't allowed to view it till you had clearance.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.734097,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"1f83727d5f42b2e36c7d28bd430a96da","i":"93a695e82d62854070387189ee96fd4d","r":"6418306:6958470:273:5114475","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6418306","6958470","273"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"O campus, para todos os efeitos, está liberado.","e":"The campus, for all practical purposes, has been cleared.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.71814,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"3e2643489cf5ce84fb26c93540d618b5","i":"97247e8738e4a903d194065ef48ea084","r":"5116410:7021651:642:3264403","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5116410","7021651","642"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Voce esta liberado para testar a laser.","e":"You're cleared to test the laser.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.857174,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"8ec88479899d9b09369b9dda20cda137","i":"d3ae0c23716d761c4dff35de45d5ac03","r":"2057392:6663412:587:98017","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["2057392","6663412","587"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Noquedizrespeito, isso ja foi liberado a nível presidencial norte-americana.","e":"With respect, this has a