 e eles precisavam para ser liberado.","e":"Yes, and they needed to be liberated.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.924864,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"c9d5ea7b13c437b306e901724f0893db","i":"5beeecd459dc0bf0e03bf56e83bc3fb8","r":"4119278:6494831:1275:907817","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4119278","6494831","1275"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"E então você será liberado de volta para o México como um cidadão livre.","e":"And then you will be released back into Mexico as a free citizen.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.867139,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"f86189d122c70ce31ae1e906d06ee9a0","i":"4da6f8b34351bd9c412dee74db98c4ba","r":"5061570:6606695:76:2109565","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5061570","6606695","76"],"w":["leaf",0]}],[]]}}}